WEBVTT

00:15.710 --> 00:18.750
<i>After seeing what we did at the park...</i>

00:18.750 --> 00:24.120
<i>for some reason, Takada-kun and I
couldn't talk to each other like normal.</i>

00:31.590 --> 00:32.910
Yay!

00:36.090 --> 00:39.100
Merry Christmas!

00:37.820 --> 00:39.100
Yay!

00:39.340 --> 00:41.650
Merry Christmas...

00:41.650 --> 00:42.470
<i>How gloomy!</i>

00:42.840 --> 00:45.320
Ooh, meat!

00:45.720 --> 00:47.650
It looks great!

00:47.650 --> 00:48.690
Good chicken...

00:48.690 --> 00:50.150
H-Hey, Adachi-san.

00:50.620 --> 00:54.640
Those two have been acting like 
this ever since they got back.

00:54.640 --> 00:56.500
Isn't something weird here?

00:56.500 --> 00:58.190
Y-Yeah.

00:58.190 --> 01:03.330
They seemed normal when we called
while they were out shopping, though.

01:05.850 --> 01:08.760
<i>Seriously, what's gotten into them?</i>

01:08.760 --> 01:11.370
<i>Just when I've graced 
them with my presence...</i>

01:11.630 --> 01:13.750
<i>This bizarre atmosphere...</i>

01:13.750 --> 01:15.550
<i>How can we fix it?</i>

01:16.280 --> 01:20.190
Hey, everyone, don't you think it's 
about time for you-know-what?

01:20.190 --> 01:21.220
"You-know-what"?

01:21.920 --> 01:23.880
The gift exchange!

01:27.610 --> 01:28.890
That's it!

01:29.400 --> 01:31.370
Th-That's what?

01:32.040 --> 01:35.120
<i>Good job, Dai-chan!
Totally ignoring the mood!</i>

03:01.860 --> 03:05.950
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

03:07.160 --> 03:11.920
<i>Episode 12 "The Christmas Party Confession"</i>

03:13.450 --> 03:15.450
Ready, and...

03:17.390 --> 03:18.960
Yay!

03:21.870 --> 03:25.520
All right, Takada-kun, you can pick 
whichever present you want first.

03:25.520 --> 03:26.660
Okay!

03:26.660 --> 03:28.490
Let me see...

03:29.810 --> 03:31.490
I pick this one!

03:31.490 --> 03:34.010
You're fine with that tiny present?

03:34.820 --> 03:39.070
In video games, the smaller ones have 
a better chance of being rare items!

03:40.070 --> 03:41.550
Ta-da!

03:41.870 --> 03:43.760
L-Lipstick?

03:45.200 --> 03:46.930
That one was mine.

03:46.930 --> 03:48.480
It's lip balm!

03:48.480 --> 03:51.450
Huh, so it's lip balm...

03:51.450 --> 03:54.410
The air gets so dry in the winter.

03:54.410 --> 03:57.890
You don't seem like the type 
to care about your lips,

03:58.960 --> 04:01.260
but boys should take good care of them, too!

04:08.940 --> 04:12.360
Hey, even I care about my lips...

04:14.720 --> 04:18.100
I'll pick this. Huh, it's making a sound.

04:15.060 --> 04:16.990
I think I'll take this one.

04:16.990 --> 04:22.190
<i>Looks like Takada-kun's still thinking 
about seeing Kasumi-oneesan kissing...</i>

04:23.120 --> 04:26.690
Ah, these stick-on mustaches 
must be from Takada-kun!

04:25.320 --> 04:26.700
<b>Stick-on Mustaches</b>

04:26.690 --> 04:29.330
Oh, yeah! That's right!

04:29.330 --> 04:31.150
I figured.

04:31.150 --> 04:34.220
Why don't I try one on right now, then?

04:34.920 --> 04:36.080
Ehem!

04:36.810 --> 04:39.720
Whoa! It's nighttime all of a sudden!

04:41.950 --> 04:42.880
What do you think?

04:42.880 --> 04:44.850
You look so awesome, Hino-kun!

04:44.850 --> 04:47.250
Th-That was mine...

04:47.250 --> 04:50.480
Th-They look great on you, Dai-chan!

04:50.480 --> 04:53.220
They're perfect with my tank top!

04:53.220 --> 04:54.970
Thanks, Umi!

04:54.970 --> 04:56.340
S-Sure!

04:56.610 --> 04:58.920
<i>Good for you, Umi-chan.</i>

05:02.480 --> 05:06.960
Oh, th-that one was from me.

05:06.960 --> 05:08.660
I thought it might be.

05:08.660 --> 05:12.360
You seem surprisingly 
discerning about clothes.

05:12.540 --> 05:15.360
O-Oh, no, you must be imagining it.

05:15.360 --> 05:19.100
It's just a discount scarf 
I could afford on my allowance.

05:19.450 --> 05:20.770
Hmm.

05:20.770 --> 05:23.340
Well, you've got a decent eye for fashion.

05:24.520 --> 05:25.840
Thanks.

05:33.990 --> 05:37.240
I-I should thank you, as well.

05:37.240 --> 05:39.700
For everything during field day...

05:40.480 --> 05:42.480
Well, yeah!

05:46.680 --> 05:48.200
Kasahara-san?!

05:49.240 --> 05:53.950
Getting called "Kasahara the Swift" was 
really embarrassing, for the record!

05:55.070 --> 05:57.920
You'll be making up for that today!

05:58.630 --> 06:01.040
M-Making up for it?

06:01.040 --> 06:03.220
<i>This </i>is<i> juice, right?</i>

06:05.120 --> 06:07.530
It turned into a huge deal.

06:07.530 --> 06:11.230
The girls in the grades below 
us even started a fan club!

06:12.820 --> 06:14.570
Unbelievable.

06:14.570 --> 06:16.910
You're the unbelievable one!

06:16.910 --> 06:19.660
I can't believe you invited 
me to this party.

06:20.780 --> 06:23.690
Wait, you're not playing dumb?

06:24.110 --> 06:26.790
I think Takada-kun's slowly 
rubbing off on you.

06:27.050 --> 06:29.700
Huh? Th-That can't be!

06:29.700 --> 06:31.400
Wait, that's the part you blush over?

06:31.870 --> 06:35.290
Something really <i>did</i> happen 
with you two earlier!

06:35.290 --> 06:38.060
H-Huh? L-L-Like what...?

06:38.060 --> 06:40.620
I mean, Takada-kun's been acting weird, too!

06:39.120 --> 06:41.260
Try these on too, Takada!

06:40.910 --> 06:45.050
You two haven't talked since you got back.
You won't even look at each other.

06:41.260 --> 06:42.760
Wh-Wh-What?

06:45.050 --> 06:48.170
You two are never like that!

06:53.460 --> 06:55.330
<i>Takada-kun...</i>

06:55.330 --> 06:57.500
See? Something's totally up!

06:57.500 --> 06:59.840
Seriously, what's your deal?!

06:59.840 --> 07:01.860
Come now, Kasahara-san!

07:14.710 --> 07:16.430
Are you okay?

07:17.690 --> 07:19.120
Nishimura-san?

07:19.750 --> 07:23.770
You've been acting strange ever 
since we were out shopping.

07:25.590 --> 07:27.260
You could tell?

07:27.260 --> 07:29.680
Yeah, pretty much.

07:31.480 --> 07:33.630
You know, Nishimura-san...

07:34.410 --> 07:37.800
I like you.

07:41.010 --> 07:46.600
I'm not sure how it's different 
from the way I like Hino-kun,

07:46.600 --> 07:51.790
Adachi-san, Kasahara-san, or the others...

07:53.520 --> 07:58.580
But I can tell it's not really the same thing.

07:59.530 --> 08:03.190
Can I... Right now, can I...

08:03.940 --> 08:07.500
Can I kiss you, Nishimura-san?

08:33.570 --> 08:36.360
Y-You can't do that, Takada-kun!

08:37.080 --> 08:39.200
You can't...

08:40.000 --> 08:44.640
The person you k-kiss someday...

08:45.190 --> 08:47.050
It might be me...

08:47.390 --> 08:49.630
It might be someone else.

08:50.390 --> 08:53.300
But... no matter who it is...

08:53.570 --> 09:00.980
I think it should be someone you 
really want to kiss deep down inside.

09:02.990 --> 09:08.690
But you're the one I really 
want to kiss deep down inside.

09:26.970 --> 09:28.680
Hey now!

09:28.680 --> 09:31.050
Don't run off to have
private conversations like that!

09:33.580 --> 09:35.110
Something's fishy...

09:35.110 --> 09:36.910
K-Kasahara-san!

09:36.910 --> 09:38.140
Takada-kun!

09:38.140 --> 09:40.130
Get in here and have a drink with me!

09:40.130 --> 09:41.850
Yay!

09:41.850 --> 09:42.560
Y-Yeah!

09:42.830 --> 09:44.060
I'll be right there!

09:44.060 --> 09:45.530
You'd better!

09:45.530 --> 09:47.270
It had better be this instant!

09:47.270 --> 09:49.270
Okay, that's enough.

09:49.270 --> 09:51.070
Hey, you've been drinking too much!

09:50.460 --> 09:53.830
That... really is just juice, right?

09:51.070 --> 09:53.160
Adachi-san, you haven't 
been drinking at all!

09:53.160 --> 09:54.940
C'mon, drink up!

09:53.830 --> 09:56.570
Yeah. I think, anyway.

09:57.010 --> 09:58.300
Let's go back inside!

09:58.300 --> 09:59.730
S-Sure.

10:00.150 --> 10:04.720
We can talk about this again 
some other time, Nishimura-san.

10:07.210 --> 10:09.100
Takada! Yay!

10:07.210 --> 10:09.820
I want some sparkling cider, too!

10:08.390 --> 10:14.060
<i>Takada-kun doesn't know what's different
about how he likes me versus everyone else.</i>

10:14.870 --> 10:18.500
<i>Can I kiss you, Nishimura-san?</i>

10:21.530 --> 10:26.070
<i>So that might have just been him 
coming on strong like usual.</i>

10:27.940 --> 10:29.350
<i>It has to be.</i>

10:29.970 --> 10:32.700
<i>After all, if it wasn't...</i>

10:34.800 --> 10:39.980
<i>My racing heart might make me lose all reason.</i>

10:41.960 --> 10:45.320
Akane-chan, what was in the gift you got?

10:45.680 --> 10:48.570
Um... good question.

10:53.900 --> 10:56.450
A t-tank top...

10:57.240 --> 10:59.590
Oh, that's so nice!

10:59.590 --> 11:01.350
How cool!

11:01.350 --> 11:03.330
Y-Yeah...

11:06.100 --> 11:10.040
I would have loved to get 
a present from Dai-chan!

11:10.040 --> 11:11.860
J-Just kidding!

11:14.560 --> 11:19.190
A-Ah, I'm not saying I didn't 
like your mustaches!

11:19.920 --> 11:23.360
I should have gotten some 
cooler-looking mustaches!

11:23.360 --> 11:25.580
H-Hey, Nishimura-san.

11:25.580 --> 11:30.090
It surprised me, but is 
Adachi-san into... well, <i>that</i>?

11:30.090 --> 11:32.790
Huh? "That"?

11:32.790 --> 11:34.540
I don't think it's much of a surprise...

11:34.960 --> 11:38.370
What?! It totally is!
It's completely left field!

11:38.370 --> 11:40.680
Hey, Nishimura-san, try it on!

11:40.680 --> 11:42.560
I'm sure you'll look super cool!

11:42.560 --> 11:45.570
Huh? I-I don't know about that...

11:46.930 --> 11:51.940
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

11:47.590 --> 11:50.180
So you're into the sporty look, huh?

11:56.440 --> 11:59.710
Yukiko-san

11:56.440 --> 12:01.450
I'm on my way now with Mom and Taiyou! Just sit tight!

11:56.610 --> 12:01.440
<i>I'm on my way now with Mom 
and Taiyou! Just sit tight!</i>

12:05.780 --> 12:13.220
<i>I think it should be someone you 
really want to kiss deep down inside.</i>

12:14.940 --> 12:20.810
<i>But you're the one I really 
want to kiss deep down inside.</i>

12:22.450 --> 12:28.080
<i>How am I supposed to face Takada-kun 
after he told me that?</i>

12:28.080 --> 12:29.830
What's wrong, Akane?

12:31.610 --> 12:33.640
N-Nothing at all!

12:33.640 --> 12:35.440
Do you have everything ready?

12:35.440 --> 12:37.620
Make sure you dress nice and warm.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.980
Y-Yeah.

12:43.900 --> 12:46.890
Happy New Year, Nishimura-san!

12:46.890 --> 12:49.080
Let's make it a good one!

12:49.800 --> 12:51.730
<i>H-He's his usual self.</i>

12:52.450 --> 12:54.160
What's the matter, Akane-chan?

12:54.160 --> 12:55.800
I-It's nothing.

12:56.400 --> 12:58.920
A happy New Year to you all.

12:58.920 --> 13:00.990
You, too!

13:00.550 --> 13:03.920
<b>Nishimura</b>

13:00.990 --> 13:03.930
Whoa, kadomatsu! Amazing!

13:04.800 --> 13:09.560
<i>So that was just Takada-kun being 
his usual outgoing self back then...</i>

13:10.230 --> 13:13.200
<i>I feel so embarrassed for letting 
it get to me like that!</i>

13:15.780 --> 13:18.310
Okay, let's go, Nishimura-san!

13:18.310 --> 13:20.970
New Year's shrine visit time!

13:21.440 --> 13:23.480
Please keep an eye on her.

13:23.480 --> 13:26.130
Sure! You can leave her to us.

13:26.840 --> 13:29.540
<i>I-I can't help but feel self-conscious!</i>

13:33.030 --> 13:36.220
Wow, it sure is busy.

13:36.220 --> 13:38.880
Is it always this packed here?

13:39.160 --> 13:40.800
I'm not sure.

13:40.800 --> 13:45.200
When I visit shrines on New Year's with Dad, 
it's after the crowds have thinned out.

13:49.560 --> 13:53.170
Oh, Umi-chan says they'll be here soon.

13:53.170 --> 13:55.930
Phew, it's freezing!

13:55.930 --> 13:58.190
I could go for some sweet sake!

13:58.190 --> 13:59.690
Sweet sake!

14:00.340 --> 14:03.240
Ooh, ooh, I want sweet sake, too!

14:03.240 --> 14:05.230
The kind for kids!

14:05.230 --> 14:07.230
I want some! I want some!

14:07.230 --> 14:08.480
Sweet sake!

14:08.480 --> 14:11.980
I'm with you, Taiyou! Let's go right now!

14:12.320 --> 14:14.110
Wait, Mom!

14:14.110 --> 14:16.570
You sure you don't want to get 
the shrine stuff done first?

14:16.570 --> 14:19.820
Huh? But I want sweet sake now!

14:19.820 --> 14:21.050
Yeah, yeah!

14:20.930 --> 14:22.160
That's not fair.

14:21.050 --> 14:24.550
Yeah! Yeah!

14:22.160 --> 14:24.540
Why do I have to be the voice of reason?

14:25.510 --> 14:28.630
Do you want some sweet sake, as well?

14:28.630 --> 14:30.700
Huh? I...

14:30.700 --> 14:32.960
I-I want some, too.

14:32.960 --> 14:35.210
Then for me...

14:36.200 --> 14:38.330
I want red bean soup with mochi!

14:38.330 --> 14:40.190
Onee-chan, you're so awesome!

14:40.630 --> 14:45.160
Well then, I'll go buy some!
You kids stay here.

14:45.160 --> 14:46.770
Yukiko, you keep watch!

14:47.250 --> 14:49.330
Off you go!

14:49.330 --> 14:52.570
Sweet, sweet... Sake, sake... Sweet sake...

14:50.150 --> 14:52.570
I can't wait, Nishimura-san!

14:52.890 --> 14:53.520
Yeah...

14:55.280 --> 14:57.090
Hmm? What is it?

14:57.090 --> 14:59.830
Oh, it's nothing.

15:01.000 --> 15:03.320
<i>He really is acting completely normal.</i>

15:03.670 --> 15:06.170
<i>I'm not sure why,
but it's comforting in a way.</i>

15:07.160 --> 15:09.240
Ah, I-I'm sorry.

15:09.240 --> 15:12.210
I was just thinking about
 how excited you seem.

15:12.480 --> 15:14.890
Are you not excited, Nishimura-san?

15:14.890 --> 15:16.680
Th-That's not what I meant!

15:16.680 --> 15:18.160
I'm excited, as well!

15:18.550 --> 15:22.630
I've never been out with friends this late,

15:22.630 --> 15:24.480
so it's all very thrilling!

15:24.870 --> 15:26.130
You're right.

15:26.130 --> 15:29.590
It's not every day you get to be 
out with friends at this hour.

15:30.000 --> 15:32.500
Oh, yeah! It's my first time, too.

15:32.950 --> 15:34.930
All thanks to you, Nishimura-san!

15:34.930 --> 15:35.710
Huh?

15:37.090 --> 15:39.670
Thanks as always, Nishimura-san.

15:39.670 --> 15:42.110
Y-You've got it backwards, Takada-kun.

15:42.370 --> 15:43.220
Huh?

15:43.670 --> 15:48.370
This past year has been full 
of precious memories for me.

15:49.180 --> 15:51.940
I couldn't have dreamed of this a year ago.

15:54.150 --> 15:58.350
I was so happy to have a friend 
ask me to walk home together.

15:59.410 --> 16:04.490
Seeing a friend cry in front of me,
which was sadder than crying myself...

16:05.820 --> 16:10.030
Sharing lunch boxes with friends 
for the very first time...

16:10.030 --> 16:13.670
Giving it my very best
on field day like never before...

16:14.560 --> 16:18.900
Celebrating Christmas with a group 
of friends for the first time...

16:19.800 --> 16:24.890
All of these firsts were moments
 I shared with you.

16:25.370 --> 16:28.290
They were all thanks to you, Takada-kun!

16:33.420 --> 16:34.840
Really?

16:34.840 --> 16:36.780
Hearing that makes me happy!

16:37.250 --> 16:39.790
It's a little embarrassing to say out loud...

16:39.790 --> 16:41.690
Huh? You think so?

16:42.260 --> 16:45.080
I don't really get it.

16:46.560 --> 16:49.360
There's lots of things I don't get.

16:54.910 --> 16:56.360
Did you know?

16:56.360 --> 17:00.120
If you tell someone what you wish for 
at your New Year's shrine visit,

17:00.120 --> 17:01.690
then it won't come true.

17:02.240 --> 17:07.320
So I hear you're not supposed to ask 
other people about their wishes.

17:07.830 --> 17:13.210
But I get the feeling that we'll 
both be wishing for the same thing.

17:13.640 --> 17:17.130
Since I'm sure that we 
both share the same love!

17:18.260 --> 17:19.760
Me, too...

17:19.760 --> 17:23.010
I think it'd be nice if we wished 
for the same thing, too.

17:26.810 --> 17:28.480
Hey, hey, hey!

17:28.480 --> 17:30.300
Drinks are here!

17:30.300 --> 17:33.450
Wait, why's your nose bleeding?

17:33.450 --> 17:36.540
Man, what a treat!

17:38.220 --> 17:40.660
Takada! Nishimura!

17:44.170 --> 17:46.250
HNY!

17:46.250 --> 17:48.470
Happy New Year!

17:48.470 --> 17:50.920
Happy New Year to you, too!

17:53.910 --> 17:58.670
<i>I wish I can enjoy another year of 
having lots of fun with everyone.</i>

18:04.300 --> 18:06.990
Nishimura-san, what did you wish for?

18:06.990 --> 18:09.720
N-No, Takada-kun!

18:09.720 --> 18:11.430
You're asking already?

18:11.430 --> 18:13.430
Oh, yeah, I forgot!

18:14.350 --> 18:18.530
<i>I think this is the right answer for now,</i>

18:18.530 --> 18:20.920
<i>although I can't ask and know for sure.</i>

18:23.130 --> 18:25.850
My parents got me a phone!

18:25.850 --> 18:28.610
Let me get your contact info, Nishimura-san!

18:30.900 --> 18:32.920
Purely for safety reasons!

18:32.920 --> 18:35.650
It's set up so you can't play games on it.

18:35.650 --> 18:38.130
Okay, I get it!

18:38.820 --> 18:42.250
I'll make sure to send you lots of messages!

18:42.250 --> 18:46.480
Now we can talk even more about stuff!

18:47.260 --> 18:48.480
<i>He seems happy.</i>

18:49.640 --> 18:54.290
<i>Sounds like we wished for 
the same thing... right?</i>

18:55.110 --> 18:59.420
<i>This must be more of Takada-kun's 
usual forward self.</i>

19:00.920 --> 19:04.620
I'd love to talk more with you, as well.

19:04.910 --> 19:06.740
Then let's share contact info!

19:07.120 --> 19:07.920
Sure.

19:08.560 --> 19:11.580
<i>I get self-conscious when he's so forward...</i>

19:12.360 --> 19:14.650
<i>but it makes me happy.</i>

19:15.250 --> 19:16.880
Takada-kun

19:15.590 --> 19:18.590
Takada-kun

19:15.590 --> 19:18.590
Happy New Year, Nishimura-san!!

19:17.630 --> 19:21.260
Takada-kun, you already said that to me lol

19:19.260 --> 19:21.260
Takada-kun

19:19.260 --> 19:21.260
You're right! That's weird!! lol

19:21.260 --> 19:26.270
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

19:22.080 --> 19:24.620
No more than thirty minutes 
of phone time per day!

19:24.620 --> 19:26.270
What?!

19:29.270 --> 19:32.470
<b>Changing Seats</b>

19:30.060 --> 19:32.890
Hey, hey! Did you hear we're changing seats?

19:32.890 --> 19:34.270
Yeah, I totally did!

19:34.270 --> 19:40.110
A boy and a girl who end up next to each 
other twice in a row are fated to fall in love!

19:40.110 --> 19:43.510
Ugh, I'm next to the Grim Reaper?

19:43.510 --> 19:46.930
This sucks! I'm gonna end up cursed!

19:47.310 --> 19:50.280
<i>This time, I'm not next to Takada-kun.</i>

19:50.890 --> 19:52.140
Sensei!

19:52.140 --> 19:57.500
I can't see the blackboard, so can I switch 
seats with the person in front of me?

19:57.770 --> 19:59.880
Yeah, go ahead.

20:00.530 --> 20:03.440
Hey, Akane-chan, are you okay with that?

20:03.830 --> 20:06.530
Huh? Yeah, of course.

20:06.850 --> 20:08.130
What?!

20:08.130 --> 20:10.510
Nishimura-san, you're next to me?!

20:11.530 --> 20:12.890
Aw yeah!

20:12.890 --> 20:15.560
Don't sound so happy about it, Takada!

20:15.560 --> 20:18.910
How many times are you two 
gonna sit next to each other?!

20:19.780 --> 20:21.140
<i>This makes twice...</i>

20:21.490 --> 20:23.680
<i>We're neighbors twice in a row.</i>

20:23.680 --> 20:25.900
You two ended up together again?

20:25.900 --> 20:26.630
Yeah!

20:26.930 --> 20:30.980
<i>I'm sure Takada-kun doesn't 
think anything of it.</i>

20:30.980 --> 20:33.680
This is the second time 
in a row, Nishimura-san!

20:34.280 --> 20:36.270
Yeah, it is.

20:37.180 --> 20:40.330
<i>What did he mean by that?</i>

22:17.770 --> 22:18.510
Oh.

22:21.640 --> 22:23.680
You dropped your eraser.

22:24.610 --> 22:26.520
Here, Nishimura-san.

22:26.520 --> 22:28.490
Th-Thanks.

22:33.400 --> 22:35.360
Wh-What's the matter?

22:36.490 --> 22:38.760
Can we stay like this for a bit longer?

22:39.260 --> 22:42.050
Huh? Wh-Why?

22:42.050 --> 22:45.550
I want lots of your curse's power!

22:48.240 --> 22:50.170
S-Sure.

22:51.340 --> 22:54.780
<i>If someone were to see us now...</i>

22:54.780 --> 22:56.770
<i>I'm sure they would tease us again.</i>

22:58.310 --> 23:02.020
<i>But I bet Takada-kun...</i>

23:02.280 --> 23:04.700
<i>wouldn't let it get to him at all.</i>

23:06.250 --> 23:07.520
<i>He's so cool...</i>

23:10.020 --> 23:13.380
I wish I could be like you, Takada-kun.

23:15.650 --> 23:18.050
Huh? What's wrong?

23:18.050 --> 23:21.200
Well, I... felt something just now.

23:24.750 --> 23:28.080
Is this your curse power?

23:29.430 --> 23:30.820
Beats me.

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next time...</b>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>10 Years Later, the Same As {teal}Today</b>
